            <p class="font-bold text-rose-800 text-sm mb-1">DANGER — Stop AC</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-rose-700 leading-relaxed">Gas leaks, compressor lockout, short circuits. Shut breaker off immediately and call a certified pro.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Search Section -->
      <section class="space-y-6" id="search-section">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl border border-zinc-200 shadow-sm p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-6">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900">Search Our Universal AC Fault Code Database</h2>
          
          <!-- Large Search Bar -->
